# Grove's Bounty with X = 3 divides its counters 1 / 2 between Bot1's Ornithopter and Elvish Mystic as it is cast. In response
# Bot2 Bolts the Mystic, so its share is lost (CR 608.2b) and only the Ornithopter gets its one counter (official ruling: the
# original distribution still applies and the counters for illegal targets are lost). The Adventure still resolves, so it is exiled.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Elusive Otter
Ornithopter
Elvish Mystic
Forest x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Elvish Mystic.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Elusive Otter.Cast(X: 3; Ability: Adventure)
Bot1.Divide(Ornithopter: 1; Elvish Mystic: 2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Elusive Otter
Bot1.Graveyard = Elvish Mystic; Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 3
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
